{"964340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fant Kids 3D Matching Game", "steam_appid": 964340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Seasons greetings!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964340/extras/ef662d1bd9ccd479358c6e7ad64b3c29.avif?t=1766243292\" width=464 height=160 /></span><br>Fant Kids are proud to present themselves in their first title,<br><strong>Fant Kids Matching Game</strong><br>Available now</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fant Kids 3D Matching Game – A Colorful 3D Matching Adventure for All Ages</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATE 12/2025 - PC, Mac, and Steam Deck support, GamePad controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fant Kids Matching Game is a cheerful and relaxing 3D memory puzzle for children, families, and anyone who enjoys simple, positive gameplay. Explore bright scenes with Fant characters Eddie and Ellie, discover playful objects, and strengthen memory and recognition skills in a friendly learning environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 Themed Matching Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of colorful locations designed to support early learning and visual memory:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alphabet letters (language-adaptive)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers 0–9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes: Cube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes: Triangle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes: Round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas snow scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wooden vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene uses approachable 3D models, gentle animations, and positive audio feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Language-Adaptive Alphabet Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The letter-matching scene changes automatically based on your selected language:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English:</strong> A–Z</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finnish:</strong> Å, Ä, Ö included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swedish:</strong> Å, Ä, Ö included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norwegian:</strong> Å, Æ, Ø included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danish:</strong> Å, Æ, Ø included</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with <strong>mouse or trackpad</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support</strong> for TV play or Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>Steam Deck</strong>, including clear UI and smooth performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on <strong>PC and Mac</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Families</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fant Kids Matching Game is gentle, colorful, and easy to understand — perfect for young learners, family play sessions, or anyone looking for a relaxing memory challenge.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fant Kids 3D Matching Game – A Colorful 3D Matching Adventure for All Ages</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATE 12/2025 - PC, Mac, and Steam Deck support, GamePad controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fant Kids Matching Game is a cheerful and relaxing 3D memory puzzle for children, families, and anyone who enjoys simple, positive ga