_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support</strong> for TV play or Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for <strong>Steam Deck</strong>, including clear UI and smooth performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on <strong>PC and Mac</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Families</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fant Kids Matching Game is gentle, colorful, and easy to understand — perfect for young learners, family play sessions, or anyone looking for a relaxing memory challenge.</p>", "short_description": "A cheerful 3D matching game for all ages. Explore 11 bright scenes—from letters and numbers to shapes, toys, space, and food items. Playable with mouse or controller, and fully supported on Steam Deck, PC, and Mac.", "supported_languages": "English, Finnish, Danish, Norwegian, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964340/35c1a02583062b5350ac008cb40a31d96d85f9d5/header.jpg?t=1766243292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964340/9a958f8983a1c57a7fc563ce6b41b775ccd0e0d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766243292", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964340/9a958f8983a1c57a7fc563ce6b41b775ccd0e0d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766243292", "website": "http://www.funfant.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> sound supported</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st